+      "content": "You know *ponerse a* + infinitive from A2 Unit 32 (*se puso a llover*, *me puse a limpiar la casa*). It is the most flexible of the \"start\" phrases, so this lesson recaps it and adds only one thing: how it differs from *echarse a*, which you met in the last lesson.\n\n*Ponerse a* works with a planned task (*se puso a trabajar*), with a sudden reaction (*se puso a llorar*) and with weather (*se puso a nevar*). *Echarse a* works only with the reaction."
