       "type": "tip",
-      "content": "En construcciones enfáticas, *llegar a + infinitivo* puede ponderar extremos de conducta insólita: *En su enojo desmedido, llegó a negarle el saludo* ('In his excessive anger, he even went so far as to deny him a greeting')."
+      "content": "*Llegar a* + a place is a different verb use you know from A1: *Llegó a la estancia* means he arrived at the ranch. When an infinitive follows *a*, you have the periphrasis, and the idea is a point reached, not a place."
